            "review_text": "Marie S\n3 contributions\n0\nScammy with Tourists\nMar 2023 • Couples\nWe ordered a peking duck and some vegetables with a tea each. Ended up paying about 45$ and got only 6 duck rice pancakes with veggies as the “peking duck dish”. They then served some noodles with duck as the 2nd half of the dish (which weren’t great tbh and not what we originally ordered). I tried discussing with the staff but they spoke such broken english, it was impossible to reason with them even through Google Translate.\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten March 9, 2023",
