            "review_text": "Geoff\nLeigh-on Sea, United Kingdom226 contributions\n0\nVery tasty..\nFeb 2019 • Family\nWe have been coming here for the last 3 years. Very impressed with the service and the food. Dim sum is original and they make the effort to make it look interesting.... They serve dim sum upto about 2.o clock. And then they have a lunch and evening menus. Which again are lovely and tasty...\nWell worth a trip if you are a tourist wanting to experience what the locals eat. Definitely beats the overpriced food that is being served by the restaurants in ho Chi Minh City centre....\nFrom the city centre its about a 10 to 25. Min taxi ride which in england money will be about £4.00.\nRead more\nWritten February 13, 2019",
