            "review_title": "Review at Dim Tu Tac",
            "review_text": "MarianneAchiam\nCopenhagen, Denmark51 contributions\n0\nAuthentic Cantonese dim sum\nFeb 2018 • Couples\nWe visited Dim Tu Tac on the recommendation of a Vietnanese/Chinese boy we spoke to at a New Year market, and we did not regret it! The atmosphere, the food, the rooms - everything was authentically Cantonese. We had delicious fried squid, roast duck, char siu pork, lo bak go (radish cake), and green beans. We ended with the dramatic black-and-gold steamed buns with cream cheese. Everything was tasty and well made, and service was super quick and efficient in the best Cantonese style. We'd definitely visit again, and wouldn't hesitate to recommend Dim You Tac to all dim sum fans out there.\nRead more\nWritten February 14, 2018",
